    <!-- About Screen -->
    <string name="about_title">About Scraply</string>
    <string name="about_intro">Scraply was crafted with a simple yet passionate vision: to help you capture, arrange, and preserve your life\'s most precious moments through a beautiful, tactile digital scrapbook.\n\nIn a world where memories are often lost in giant, endless digital feeds, Scraply gives you the creative space to slow down. You can capture unique custom stamps from your daily surroundings, write down your deepest reflections, and freely arrange them on raw texture canvases. Every design is a reflecting window to your personal journey, designed with total freedom. Thank you for choosing Scraply to tell your beautiful stories!</string>
